tools\win98se-extracted\wdm\ccport.sys         4.10.2222        31680 0D09CE27EA50767FE9213D3EC17D70D92A1F2B0FB98CDCBF29F488B216F3667B Win98 SE CD - WDM Modem Port Driver; layout2.inf "ccport.sys=5,,31680"
